              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mazu amwana kaHakaliya Nehemiya. Mukakweji Kisilevi, mumwaka wamakumi ayedi chinadiŋi muŋanda muShushani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mana kwami wumu Hanani, wenjili nawamayala amakwawu amuYuda. Hinukuyihula nsaŋu jawaYudeya apulukili, asheluhu kudiawa ayili muwuduŋu, ninsaŋu jaYerusalema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyakuŋila nawu, Awaayili muwuduŋu anashaluhu, adi muna muwuloŋu, adi nakumona ihuŋunankashi nikusawuka; nimpwembu yahumuka dehi, niyenzelu yayuyasukuma dehi nakesi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.1.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chinatiyili mazu owu hinukushakama nakudila nakudishishimo kamafuku amu; hinukushakama nanzala nakulomba kumesu aNzambi wewulu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nami, Eyi Yehova Nzambi wewulu, Nzambi muneni wakutiyawoma nankashi, wahembaŋa chitiyaŋenu naluwi nanawa amukeŋa ahembaŋa kuleja kwindi, nakulembeli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "itu deyi ditiyilili, mesu eyi atoni, kulondawutiyilili kulomba kwamami kambuŋeyi kunukulomba kumesu eyi katatakani mwaana niwufuku, kwakulombela ambuŋeyi anyana kaIsarela, kwakwitija mwana vulumunuwu anyana kaIsarela namutunakuvulumuni, mwalala ninaminimutaŋa wawankakulula jami tunakuvulumuni dehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tunakwili dehi chatama nankashi, hitunahembi hela kuleja, hela yidika, hela wuŋaji walejelikambuŋeyi Mosuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakulembeli, anukaku izu diwalejeli kambuŋeyi Mosi, diwelili neyi, Neyi mwakamotoka nshimbi, ami nakayimwaŋila mwahitanyuza yawantu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ilaŋa neyi mwakafunta kudami, nakuhemba kuleja kwaminakwilamu, hela akwenu anakinjikuwu adi kwakweni kunsa yewulu nakayi fumishaku, nakayipompesha nakuyileta cheŋi kumukala wunatondi kushaka mishaku ijina dami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awa hiyambuŋeyi hiyantu eyi iwakúulili naŋovu yeyi yeneni, nachikasa cheyi chaŋovu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi mwanta, nakulembeli, itu deyi ditiyilili kulomba kwamami kambuŋeyi, nikulomba kwawambuŋeyi atiyaŋa kuwaha kwakama ijina deyi. Aŋitiji mwani, ami kambuŋeyi, leluniyi chachiwahi, nimonuhu wushona kudi iwu iyala. Muloŋa ami nadiŋi mukwakuhana lupasa lwamwanta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.1.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
